  "label": "User projected onto the scene of Colonel Sanders opening a KFC in Wakanda",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the imagined scenario described in the meme, where Colonel Sanders (the visual material) is depicted as the central actor performing the action of opening a KFC in Wakanda (the scene). The humor and satire of the meme rely on the user imagining themselves or identifying with the character of Colonel Sanders in this fictional context. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the text, but the meme's structure invites the user to project their own perspective onto the scenario, making the user the implied observer or participant in the satirical scene.",
